NO   The text describes humanitarian aid (accommodation, supplies) and logistical efforts for refugees from Ukraine, but there is **no explicit mention of:
- labour market integration (B4) — no skills gap, vacancy filled, or short-term work permit mention;
- economic benefits (B1–B3, B5) — no GDP, tax revenue, pension system, degree recognition, or lost economic output due to barriers.**
